# Two vendor drivers' devices in one isolation group (S1): the HDA and the
# e1000e as functions 0 and 1 of one device behind a root port, as the HP's
# Wi-Fi sits beside its NVMe disk. Claims are made at boot; the serial says
# whether the second was refused or shared.
until:Capsules spawned:1800
until:[SPLASH] stepped aside:900
wait:90
shot:setup
